"""MagSurveyPy Archaeological Magnetometry Prospection Suite — command-line application.

Developed by Alexandru Hegyi, PhD
Website: https://alexandruhegyi.com
Email: alexandruhegyi@gmail.com
GitHub: https://github.com/alexandruhegyi

MagSurveyPy exposes its scientific processing engine through a packaged command-line module. The major
processing engines are grouped as GNSS/RTK, PRM acquisition, universal import/assembly,
gridding, filtering/denoising, image enhancement and segmentation. Terminal branding is
isolated in the small `magsurveypy_banner.py` module so UTF-8/ANSI handling cannot affect
scientific processing.
"""
